{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2023-04-20 17:33:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DALLAS , APRIL 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE: KMB) HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.18 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JULY 5, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JUNE 9, 2023.'}